# the same function with direct calls withheld: the read and the call are copied as they are written
# RUN: walk f5 mechanisms=-DirectCalls
# CHECK: PropGet {{*}}key="area"
# CHECK: Call
# RUN(NEVER): walk f5 mechanisms=-DirectCalls
# NEVER-NOT: CallTable
